[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/35022886/f0c31e73c6a42854cd646885018cc9e61ae2bd80.jpg[/img]

Hey guys!

We are very happy with the acceptance of our game and we would like to thank all players for their [b]Feedback and Reviews [/b]!!!

Many of the improvements have been implemented by listening to what you have to say!ːsteamhappyː

Today we are happy to launch the [b]2nd Stage of Early Access![/b]

[u][b]Stay tuned for news![/b][/u]

+ continue to follow Andrew's story;
+ now the adventure mode targets have several locations where they can appear and if you want to try to improve your score just click on “Try again!” that all your progress and scores will be erased, allowing you to have fun again and try to improve the ranking;
+ 4 new missions in Adventure Mode;
+ 4 new quests in Find Mode, some with 2 objectives and more than 50 different locations for each stage;
+ now the number of bullets varies according to the difficulty of the phase in Search Mode, allowing more chances;
+ now inside the game you will be able to know the update news, just click on the “News” button on the start screen;
+ the aim stability was improved;
+ improvements to the Search Mode interface;
+ game optimization;
+ 6 new achievements;

[u][b]Community[/b][/u]

We opened two new topics in the Steam community to improve our communication:

[b]- “Do you have any suggestions or ideas ??? Tell us! ”[/b]

Our intention is to make [b]Geometric Sniper [/b]more and more fun, that's why we put the game on Early Access, so that you can participate in this process and help us achieve this goal! We look forward to hearing what you guys think!

[b]- "Do you have any suggestions to improve our translation?"[/b]

We are a small studio and for this reason the translation into English was done by ourselves. It can certainly be improved, so we are opening this topic to anyone who wants to help or has any suggestions for improvement. We will be happy with your help!

Soon we will also make the translation available in Portuguese and we intend to translate the game into other languages.

What language would you like to see our game in? You can take advantage of this topic to tell us too ...

[u][b]Upcoming Updates:[/b][/u]

We have a lot of news and we look forward to telling you ...

[b]Be sure to follow us on the studio's page on Steam, so you will know about new games and news from the studio.[/b]

We hope everyone has a lot of fun with the game and [b]don't forget to tell us what you think of the new missions !!![/b]

Once again thank you all!

You are Awesome!
